## Critical architecture notes

- **NO `/vendor` portal** — all org types use `/dashboard`. See `hubents-unified-portal.mdc`.
- **7 universal roles** — owner, admin, manager, accountant, staff, viewer, client. No provider-specific roles.
- **Plan-driven features** — event creation, portfolio, public profile gated by plan, not orgType.
- After role/permission changes: run `scripts/hard-reset-permissions.ts`.
- After plan/feature changes: run `scripts/seed-plans.ts`.

## Data protection (NEVER skip) — see skill `neon-data-protection`

- **2 branches, both PROTECTED:** `vercel-dev-recovered` (production data) + `production` (backup)
- **NEVER remove protection** — never run `reset-db.ts` against production data
- **Daily backups** run via `.github/workflows/db-backup.yml` (pg_dump → R2)
- **History retention: 30 days** — allows PITR within the last month
- **Neon-Vercel integration** can delete unprotected branches — always protect BEFORE connecting
- **Disaster recovery:** `hubents-database-migration` skill has 12-step rebuild; `neon-data-protection` has full incident report and prevention guide

See **`AGENTS.md`** at repo root for the full map.
